Device Import/Production - Tariff
Legal basis for calculation of compensation for remuneration under Section 36 (2) of the Copyright Act :
The person identified under Section 36 (3) shall pay private copying remuneration for the use of a work under Section 42 for the following:
a) Blank recording media allowing to save or preserve a copy of the work, namely a CD, DVD, Blu-ray, minidisc, magnetic tape or other similar optical, magnetic or electronic medium, or USB stick, memory card, HD, not built-in in a technical device, in the amount of 6% of the import price or sale price of such medium;
b) Technical device allowing to make a copy of the work on HD, USB stick, memory card or a medium under letter b) or another technical device with such an effect or function, the one as audio or audio-video recorder, set-top box allowing to make or save a copy of the work on another independent technical device or recording medium, video game console, smart TV, mp3 or mp4 players or another technical device with such effect, except of technical devices under letters c) and g) and except of technical devices listed under second indent of letter a), in the amount of 3% of the import price or sale price of such technical device;
c) Technical device allowing to make a copy of the work, a mobile phone, in the amount of 0.7% of the import price or sale price of such technical device;
d) Technical device allowing to make a copy of the work, a tablet, in the amount of 0.6% of the import price or sale price of such technical device;
e) Technical device allowing to make a copy of the work, a computer, in the amount of 0.85% of the import price or sale price of such technical device;
f) Technical device allowing to make a copy of the work, a video camera, in the amount of 1% of the import price or sale price of such technical device;
g) Technical device allowing to make a copy of the work, a camera, in the amount of 0.35% of the import price or sale price of such technical device;
